15
00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:49.230
Yes.

16
00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:49.530
Right?

17
00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:50.050
Uh-huh.

18
00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:50.670
It's amazing.

19
