I had sad streamers left over from some Christmas craft I did.

20
00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:56.590
And Cassie brought balloons.

21
00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:57.910
And some partially inflated balloons.

22
00:00:58.030 --> 00:00:58.650
We did that.

23
00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:00.330
Cassie and I partially inflated them.

24
