But it's actually a little wonky and just perfect.

27
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:07.690
Here is the thing.

28
00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:09.230
Do not take this the wrong way.

29
00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:16.030
But the greatest thing about doing, like, the office-themed, it is your birthday decorations

30
