is that they can be real bad.

31
00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:19.330
I know.

32
00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:20.230
And it works.

33
00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:20.570
I know.

34
00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:22.270
Like, it is all on theme.

35
00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:23.170
And I love it.

36
00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:27.110
You have very colorful balloons, which I think is right.

37
00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:28.030
It's a milestone year.

38
00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:28.810
It is your 50th.

39
00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:29.370
It's the 50th.

40
00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:30.150
It is your 50th.

41
00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.470
So, I think you get colorful, sad balloons on your milestones.

42
