Gray and brown balloons, just FYI, are harder to find.

43
00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:36.470
They are, right?

44
00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:38.510
Or gray or whatever colors they use.

45
00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:38.790
Yeah.

46
00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:39.830
Oh, my gosh.

47
00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:41.150
It was a surprise.

48
00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:47.350
When I came in the door this morning, I accidentally, like, punched my knuckle into

49
00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.250
the metal door handle.

50
00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:51.290
And I...

51
