55
00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.210
It was so painful.

56
00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:02.630
And I was so grumpy as I was coming in.

57
00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:03.990
I'm like, oh, my gosh.

58
