I'm like, I'm here.

59
00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:05.790
I'm limping in.

60
00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:07.870
And then you guys were, like, surprised.

61
00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:09.950
I was like, oh, my goodness.

62
00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:13.330
I went from, like, this low moment to this high moment.

63
00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:14.250
It was so amazing.

64
00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:16.050
This is awesome, lady.

65
00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:17.750
Yes, my 50th.

66
00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:19.210
It's happening this week.

67
