00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.190
I wore a Joshua Tree sweatshirt.

75
00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:34.590
I know.

76
00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.330
I feel like my celebration is starting.

77
00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:41.670
