1521
01:01:45.350 --> 01:01:47.530
And are they doing anything about it?

1522
01:01:47.650 --> 01:01:48.650
This I can't find out.

1523
01:01:48.930 --> 01:01:50.250
Are they changing the bottoms?

1524
