1526
01:01:56.030 --> 01:02:00.370
I mean, I'm telling you, it's bonkers.

1527
01:02:00.970 --> 01:02:05.950
This, of all the things I thought we were going to talk about today for this last episode,

1528
01:02:05.950 --> 01:02:10.930
it was not that you can see all the bits of the baseball player.

1529
01:02:11.130 --> 01:02:12.730
And they're all wearing them.

1530
01:02:13.970 --> 01:02:19.590
Nobody – and if you go like online, there's all these – it's very funny that like people

1531
01:02:19.590 --> 01:02:24.670
